Teach openal-soft that visionOS is a device platform, not desktop macOS.

Three guards miss visionOS, all with the same root cause: TARGET_OS_IPHONE is
1 there but TARGET_OS_IOS is 0, and CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME is visionOS -- so every
test written as "iOS or tvOS, else desktop macOS" silently takes the macOS
branch.

  1. common/alsem.h selects between libdispatch and POSIX semaphores. visionOS
     falls through to sem_init, which is NOT implemented on any Apple platform
     (it fails with ENOSYS), so al::semaphore's constructor throws
     resource_unavailable_try_again out of ContextBase's constructor and out
     of alcCreateContext -- which is noexcept, so the process aborts. Every
     app linking this on visionOS dies the first time it opens an audio
     context, whatever backend is selected.
  2. alc/backends/coreaudio.cpp includes <IOKit/audio/IOAudioTypes.h> for
     device enumeration. XROS.sdk has no such header; enumeration is macOS-only
     here, exactly as on iOS and tvOS.
  3. CMakeLists.txt links -framework AudioUnit -framework ApplicationServices.
     Neither is linkable on visionOS; AudioUnit is subsumed by AudioToolbox and
     ApplicationServices does not exist.

Upstreamable as-is.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 060a740..c02c9b7 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1130,7 +1130,7 @@ if(ALSOFT_BACKEND_COREAUDIO)
         set(BACKENDS  "${BACKENDS} CoreAudio,")
 
         set(EXTRA_LIBS -Wl,-framework,CoreAudio ${EXTRA_LIBS})
-        if(CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME MATCHES "^(iOS|tvOS)$")
+        if(CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME MATCHES "^(iOS|tvOS|visionOS)$")
             find_library(COREFOUNDATION_FRAMEWORK NAMES CoreFoundation)
             if(COREFOUNDATION_FRAMEWORK)
                 set(EXTRA_LIBS -Wl,-framework,CoreFoundation ${EXTRA_LIBS})
diff --git a/alc/backends/coreaudio.cpp b/alc/backends/coreaudio.cpp
index 138859c..d835fc9 100644
--- a/alc/backends/coreaudio.cpp
+++ b/alc/backends/coreaudio.cpp
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
 #include <AudioUnit/AudioUnit.h>
 #include <AudioToolbox/AudioToolbox.h>
 
-#if TARGET_OS_IOS || TARGET_OS_TV
+#if TARGET_OS_IOS || TARGET_OS_TV || TARGET_OS_VISION
 #define CAN_ENUMERATE 0
 #else
 #include <IOKit/audio/IOAudioTypes.h>
diff --git a/common/alsem.h b/common/alsem.h
index b23a54a..a0dfcf3 100644
--- a/common/alsem.h
+++ b/common/alsem.h
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 #if defined(__APPLE__)
 #include <AvailabilityMacros.h>
 #include <TargetConditionals.h>
-#if (((MAC_OS_X_VERSION_MIN_REQUIRED > 1050) && !defined(__ppc__)) || TARGET_OS_IOS || TARGET_OS_TV)
+#if (((MAC_OS_X_VERSION_MIN_REQUIRED > 1050) && !defined(__ppc__)) || TARGET_OS_IOS || TARGET_OS_TV || TARGET_OS_VISION)
 #include <dispatch/dispatch.h>
 #define AL_APPLE_HAVE_DISPATCH 1
 #else
